  "source_groundedness": 0.8,
  "rationale": "The set provides several genuinely useful qualitative theme axes (crew service, food, seat condition, class expectation gap) that let the analyst group and compare Overall Rating across Type of Traveller and Class beyond the existing numeric ratings. A few columns are redundant with each other or with original columns (value_for_money_perception, service_decline_perception), lowering holistic usefulness. Groundedness is generally solid with sensible NULLs, but several columns almost never emit NULL and appear to project a single review's overall tone onto specific unmentioned themes (e.g., a seat-focused review getting poor food and poor service/consistency labels), indicating some unsupported specifics."
